  "description": "UXENAO02 crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H95 Dy6 N12 O34 5+,5(Cl1 1-),2(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.930-4.000 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.79-111.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(μ3-OH)(CO3)3(bsc)3(MeOH)14(H2O)]Cl5·(H2O)·(MeOH)2 (C64H105Cl5Dy6N12O37). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
